        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yahova akalagira zihiiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova avoora, “Ligulu liveeye endeve yange yu vwami na lirova liveeye endeve yukuviika ku virenge viange. Kunangwa mulanyumbakira inyumba ya lugano ki; havundu hange hokomenya halava ha lugano ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzi mwene ndaalomba ligulu ni lirova! Nyanzizangwa na yavo avaveeye avahocha na aviliegehiza, avatizaa nukuhulira inzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Avandu vakora kuli vayaanza. Gaveeye malala meere kuvo, niiva vita igiriki kuli kisiuviriru anoho vavunanyie ligoti lie imbwa; niiva valahaana kihanwa chuvuswage anoho vahane masahi gi inguruvi; vahaana kimuli anoho vasaale ku kifananyi gaveeye malala meere kuvo. Yee, vasangalira mu zinzira ziavo ziukusigamira zielivihiliriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira yaga, inzi kandi ndavaletera ikivi - ivindu yivio viavatizaa; kigira sihaaliho nu mulala uwahugira lwa ndavalanga anoho uwahuliriza lwa ndamoloma. Vaatovora kuvula kuhulira inzi nokokola uvudamanu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhuliri icha Yahova avoora, munyi avamutizaa nukumuhulira: “Kigira muveeye avasuuvirifu ku inzi, valala ku vandu vinyu vene vamudunyira na sivalava ni cha vamukola mba. Vamukolera kehenyahenye nivavoora; ‘Leka Yahova amanyie ovonene vwivwe na amuhonyie, kunangwa kuduuki kolola munyi nimusangara.’ Navuzwa yavo aveene valava muzisoni! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhulirizi! Liyoga lie kivihiri kutura mu lidaala linene, huliri mwoyo yigwo kutura mu Litembeli, goveeye mwoyo gwa Yahova nahaana mageri ku avasigu veve!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lidaala linene litakatifu liange liveeye kuli mukali wiivula umwana vugira kuva ni lilumwa. Lilumwa nilikikiri kuduuka kuye, wiivuywi mwana muyayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nivwaha wahulira ku kindu kuli yiki? Nivwaha walola ku vindu kuli yivi? Kivala kinyala kolombwa ku mu lidiku lilala? Ihiiri inyala kwivulwa ku ing'inga indala? Navuzwa lwa Ziyoni silalumwa ku ing'inga indambi nikikiri kwivura avana valio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaganagana ndi ndakora avandu vange vaduuki ku ing'inga yi liivulwa ma mbaleke vavuli kwivulwa mba.” Yahova umali kovora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musangare harara na Jerusalemi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova avoora, “Ndamuletera limedeka liu vutugi vunyingi litahera mba; uvutugi vwi zihiiri vwiutululuka ku munyi kuli mugera gutakamaa. Mulava kuli mwana mudoto olelangwa na mama weve, agingangwa mu maha, nukulindwa muvuyaanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndamuleminya mwoyo mu Jerusalemi kuli mama aleminyaa umwana weve mwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa muloraa yaga nigekoleka, mulasangale. Galamukola muve nizinguru kandi avalamu. Maku mulamanya ndi inzi Yahova, ngonyaa yavo avambuliranga, kandi manyianga uvutima vwange ku vasigu vange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova alaza numuliru, na magare geege gu vulwani gaveeye kuli kihuzuzi. Alaleeta uvutima vwivwe vululu hasi ni iligondoka lilie kuli lomemo lwu muliru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova alaleeta likalaga lilie liu muliru kandi alahaana amageri gi kivavi ku vandu vosi. Yavo ava Yahova aliita valava vanyingi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova avoora, “Keheri keveeye ahimbi ku yavo avitakasa aveene lisigamira misambwa, kandi avazizaa mu milimi jukusigamira nivalonda yavo misambwa avalizaa zinyama zie zimbizi, kandi zinyama zia amajungu harara ni zinyama zindi ziu kuvihiliriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzi manyirizi zing'anagani ziavo, kandi miyinzi jaavo. Inzi nziza kuvungiza avandu vi zihiiri ziosi harara. Lwa navaze harara, valakalole likora lie zinguru ziange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi valamanya ndi inzi Yahova mbana amageri kuvo. Navuzwa ndahonyia valala nukuvatuma ku zihiiri, ziveeye mu vivala vikagatanaa ni inyanza - Tarishishi, Libia, Lidia kivala keveeye na vasaza vaveeye ni limanya liu kulasa uvuta, Tubali kandi Ivuguriki. Avandu vakikiri kuhulira luyali lwange anoho avakikiri kolola ovonene kandi zinguru ziange, hagati hi zihiiri yizi, valalandiza ovonene vwange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Valaleta avamwavo vinyu vosi kutura mu zihiiri ziosi vave kuli kihanwa ku inzi. Valaletwa ku kiguru change kitakatifu mu Jerusalemi, ni vagingiywi ku zibarasi, amagare gu vulwani, zibunda, zisukiri, kandi zing'amia, kuli avandu va Isiraeli valeta uvuswage mu viju ivilahi kuli kihanwa mu litembeli liange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avalala kuvo, ndavakora vave avasaalisi kandi avandi vave vandu va Levi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Avandu vange harara ni visukululwi viavo valamenya mihiga ni mihiga, kuli ligulu lihia kandi lirova lihia via ndilomba vilakamenye mihiga ni mihiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku vuli lilia liu mweli muhia, kandi ku vuli lisabato, avandu vosi vi ihiiri valaza kusigamira mu lidaala linene lia Jerusalemi,” Yahova avoora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Avandu vosi valazia nokohenza ku miviri jakuza jayavo avamala kwibaala ku inzi. Zing'ende zililia miviri jaavo na si zilakuza mba, kandi muliru guvasamba si gulasiminywa mba, kandi valava chu kuvihiliriza ku vandu vosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
